From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 11 May 2026 14:27:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 451/913] drivers: stm32_tamp: remove duplicated PRIVCFGR
 macros
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Drop duplicated _TAMP_PRIVCFG/_TAMP_PRIVCFGR defines.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 636521a8c7e34d7dfefcf60ee5b7ce34b3a96f1c drivers: stm32_tamp: remove duplicated PRIVCFGR macros]
Fixes: 69b8b983d80e ("drivers: add stm32 tamper domain driver")
Change-Id: I3af3c32bc0f8d4120106818b6cefbf64f55770e2
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
---
 core/drivers/stm32_tamp.c | 9 ---------
 1 file changed, 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/drivers/stm32_tamp.c b/core/drivers/stm32_tamp.c
index fc05a4b9e..7125e6a38 100644
--- a/core/drivers/stm32_tamp.c
+++ b/core/drivers/stm32_tamp.c
@@ -104,15 +104,6 @@
 #define _TAMP_PRIVCFGR_RIF_R1		BIT(1)
 #define _TAMP_PRIVCFGR_RIF_R2		BIT(2)
 
-/* _TAMP_PRIVCFGR bit fields */
-#define _TAMP_PRIVCFG_CNT2PRIV		BIT(14)
-#define _TAMP_PRIVCFG_CNT1PRIV		BIT(15)
-#define _TAMP_PRIVCFG_BKPRWPRIV		BIT(29)
-#define _TAMP_PRIVCFG_BKPWPRIV		BIT(30)
-#define _TAMP_PRIVCFG_TAMPPRIV		BIT(31)
-#define _TAMP_PRIVCFGR_MASK		(GENMASK_32(31, 29) | \
-					 GENMASK_32(15, 14))
-
 /*_TAMP_CR1 bit fields */
 #define _TAMP_CR1_ITAMP(id)		BIT((id) - INT_TAMP1 + U(16))
 #define _TAMP_CR1_ETAMP(id)		BIT((id) - EXT_TAMP1)
